!.env.example
# alembic/versions/*.py was excluded here and nowhere else. The image shipped an
# empty versions directory, so `alembic upgrade head` found no revisions, exited
# 0, and left the empresas schema with zero tables — which read as "migrations
# are up to date" instead of "there are no migrations". Every other service
# ships its versions; this one has to as well, all the more so once services
# migrate themselves on startup.
